ent-WFCorruptionBranch = branch
    .desc = A knot of grey flesh that pushes the growth outward. Cut it down and what it fed starves.
ent-WFCorruptionRoot = root
    .desc = A fat root sunk into the deck. It feeds the growth around it. Cut it down and what it fed starves.
ent-WFCorruptionPropagator = propagator
    .desc = A swollen lump the size of a man's chest. The growth spreads a long way from it. Kill it and the growth around it starves.
ent-WFRemadeLamp = glowing nodule
    .desc = A sickly yellow lump that gives off a weak light.
ent-WFRemadeEye = eye
    .desc = It knows you. It turns to follow you, and the dead hear about it.
ent-WFRemadeCyst = cyst
    .desc = A fat sac stuck to the wall. It spits a bio-bomb at anything that walks across its front, then takes a while to refill.
ent-WFRemadeCystBomb = bio-bomb
    .desc = A wriggling thing that looks ready to burst.
ent-WFRemadeSnare = snare
    .desc = A coil of flesh on the deck. Step on it at a run and it drags you down. Walk round it, or burn it.
ent-WFRemadeMaw = maw
    .desc = A mass of wet teeth. Stand on it and it takes three seconds to grab you. It bites off arms and legs and eats the dead. Pull someone free, or kill it.
ent-WFRemadeNest = nest
    .desc = A lump of flesh that slowly makes the dead get up. It never holds more than a couple at a time.
ent-WFRemadeHarvester = harvester
    .desc = It soaks up everything alive or dead around it for the stone. Kill it.

wf-remade-snare-trip = Something coils round your legs and drags you down!

wf-remade-maw-warn-self = The maw stretches out to grab you! Get off it now!
wf-remade-maw-warn-other = The maw stretches out to grab {THE($target)}!
wf-remade-maw-grab = The maw drags {THE($target)} into itself!
wf-remade-maw-bite = The maw bites {THE($target)}.
wf-remade-maw-limb = The maw tears a limb off {THE($target)} and swallows it!
wf-remade-maw-pull = You get hold of {THE($target)} and start pulling.
wf-remade-maw-struggle = You wrench against the maw.
wf-remade-maw-freed = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} comes free of the maw.

wf-remade-eye-watched = A shiver runs down your spine. You are being watched.
